# The field and variant names `bdinfo_rs_wasm::mirror`'s `Deserialize` derives
# compare an input key against — every `#[serde(rename_all = "camelCase")]`
# property of `Disc`, `Playlist`, `Stream`, `Clip`, `Chapter` and `ScanError`,
# plus every lower-cased enum variant of `HiddenRule`, `ScanStage` and the
# `kind`-tagged `ScanErrorReason`.
#
# Kept for the record rather than wired up: see fuzz/README.md for what it was
# measured to be worth against `dictionaries/json.dict` on the same corpus copy
# and budget.

